            "review_title": "Review at Nom Bo Kho Long Vi Dung",
            "review_text": "Travelly HN\nHanoi, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nMy New Favorite Kind Of Salad\nJun 2022\n\"At first, I thought it was a papaya salad but it was so much more.\n\nIt contains a mixture of veggies like papaya, basil, mint,...; a few kinds of meat like beef jerky, charsiu but what I really like is the sauce. It was light, a bit savory and sweet, perfect to connect everything together and make this salad super balanced and refreshing.\n\nThere are also other types of snack and drinks there as well. The whole meal cost me and my friend just about VND150.000 and we were delighted and happy!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2022",
